## opencode-lcm

`openseek-lcm` is a port of **opencode-lcm** — <https://github.com/Plutarch01/opencode-lcm>
(npm: `opencode-lcm`) — the OpenCode implementation of Lossless Context Memory.

This project reproduces upstream's archive model, 18-tool surface, scope ladder, search
ranking behaviour and dry-run-first maintenance commands. The upstream work is licensed
